  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "50-50",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h3>Proof of quality starts with the details. With ZOLLER, you check everything that is decisive for quality.</h3>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c686",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>Check your tools and grinding wheels to create irrefutable chains of evidence for process and product quality. Machining companies use ZOLLER to measure new tools at goods receipt and reliably detect wear patterns during production. Grinding shops record parameters for the regrinding process. As a tool manufacturer, you check the quality of initial samples and tool batches. The precision is outstanding: up to 0.1 µm.</strong></p> <p>ZOLLER has the right inspection equipment for every requirement: Manual devices for checks in seconds, automated inspection devices with incident and transmitted light, inspection devices for SKP and roughness as well as fully automatic universal measuring machines for complex tasks. Create digital twins or ensure your tool quality in 2D and 3D with more than 100 parameters.</p> <p>Tool inspections with ZOLLER answer quality questions with precise data.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/products/inspection-measuring\">Show products</a></p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c687",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
   ],
   "ftype": "container-2cols",
   "id": "c685",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-small",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Inspection and interaction </h2>",
   "body": "<p>All ZOLLER devices for measuring and inspecting tools are equipped with the »pilot 4.0« measuring device software and the z.One database.</p> <p>All setting, measuring and inspection data for tools and grinding wheels can be stored either in the machine or centrally. From there, they can be automatically transferred to your CNC-controlled grinding or production machines using other ZOLLER technologies.</p> <p>With ZOLLER, you are also ideally prepared for the exchange with all common CAD/CAM systems. </p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "text",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c693",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-large",
    "after": "extra-large"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2 class=\"headline-decor\"> Create clarity in seconds </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Check during the process whether the data for the CNC grinding machine is correct. With the devices in the »pom series«, you can manually measure 70 parameters directly next to the machine in a matter of seconds. You know immediately whether your processes are programmed for success.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/6/csm_inspection-and-measuring_01_c90e4b3d76.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1920,
     "h": 1967
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c689",
   "bg": "white",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2 class=\"headline-decor\"> Measure to an accuracy of 0.1 µm </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">With ZOLLER, you can analyze with microscopic precision and use state-of-the-art imaging. The sensor technology in the »mµFocus« inspection device resolves structures on the cutting edge preparation and surface roughness with an accuracy of up to 0.1 µm. Image processing with »pilot 4.0« creates precise two- and three-dimensional visualizations.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/d/csm_inspection-and-measuring_02_68ae6129c7.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1920,
     "h": 1967
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c690",
   "bg": "white",
   "space": {
    "before": "none",
    "after": "none"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2 class=\"headline-decor\"> Simple and reproducible testing </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Tool inspection with ZOLLER is easy because we have tailored our hardware and software accordingly. With the optional CNC control for »smileCheck« and »smartCheck« or the fully automated »genius series«, tool inspections are successful even without extensive training. The »elephant« software module also provides support with automatic tool recognition and clever operator guidance. </p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/6/csm_inspection-and-measuring_03_019456175f.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1920,
     "h": 1967
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c691",
   "bg": "white",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "default"
   }
